<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>WastedToken Mint — Die-struck collectible challenge coins</title>
<style>
/* ============ base ============ */
*{box-sizing:border-box}
:root{
  --bg:#06070b;
  --bg2:#0a0c12;
  --panel:#0e1119;
  --panel2:#12161f;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  --line2:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  --txt:#eae7e1;
  --dim:#98a0ae;
  --brass:#e6b573;
  --brass2:#c98c3e;
  --copper:#c8763c;
  --silver:#cbd4e0;
  --violet:#9b8bdd;
  --max:1240px;
  --ff-disp:"Iowan Old Style",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  --ff-body:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  --ff-mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace;
}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--ff-body);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;line-height:1.6;
}
body::before{
  content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(1100px 700px at 78% -8%,rgba(230,181,115,.13),transparent 62%),
    radial-gradient(900px 620px at 8% 12%,rgba(120,105,220,.10),transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(1000px 900px at 50% 108%,rgba(200,118,60,.08),transparent 62%);
}
body::after{
  content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;opacity:.35;
  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0 1px,transparent 1px 3px);
  mix-blend-mode:overlay;
}
main,header,footer{position:relative;z-index:2}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--ff-disp);font-weight:600;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:0}
p{margin:0}
.grad{
  background:linear-gradient(100deg,#fff3dd 0%,var(--brass) 34%,#a9722c 62%,#ffe6bd 92%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
}
.mono{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}

/* ============ nav ============ */
.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;backdrop-filter:blur(14px) saturate(140%);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,7,11,.88),rgba(6,7,11,.55));border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav-in{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:14px 26px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;flex:0 0 auto}
.mark{width:34px;height:34px;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 10px rgba(230,181,115,.35))}
.brand-txt{font-family:var(--ff-disp);font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.005em}
.brand-txt em{font-style:normal;color:var(--brass);margin-left:.32em}
.links{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-left:auto}
.links a{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.02em;position:relative;padding:4px 0}
.links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:100%;bottom:0;height:1px;background:var(--brass);transition:right .35s}
.links a:hover{color:var(--txt)}
.links a:hover::after{right:0}
.nav-cta{border:1px solid var(--line2);padding:9px 17px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);transition:.3s}
.nav-cta:hover{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--brass),var(--brass2));color:#20150a;border-color:transparent}
@media(max-width:880px){.links{display:none}}

/* ============ hero ============ */
.hero{padding:74px 26px 46px}
.hero-in{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);border:1px solid rgba(230,181,115,.28);
  padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(230,181,115,.06)}
.eyebrow .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brass);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--brass);animation:pulse 2.4s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}
h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6.1vw,74px);margin:22px 0 20px}
.lede{color:var(--dim);font-size:17px;max-width:44ch}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:28px 0 34px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;transition:.32s;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer}
.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f6d9a6,var(--brass) 45%,var(--brass2));color:#231607;font-weight:600;
  box-shadow:0 10px 34px -12px rgba(230,181,115,.7)}
.btn.primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px -12px rgba(230,181,115,.85)}
.btn.ghost{border-color:var(--line2);color:var(--txt);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--brass);color:var(--brass)}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,auto);gap:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px}
.stats div{padding-right:18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.stats div:last-child{border-right:0}
.stats dt{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}
.stats dd{margin:5px 0 0;font-family:var(--ff-disp);font-size:22px}
.hero-stage{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.stage-frame{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:580px;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,255,255,.055),rgba(255,255,255,0) 45%)}
#coin-hero{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:16px;background:#08090e}
.tick{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;border-color:var(--brass);opacity:.75}
.tick.tl{top:-1px;left:-1px;border-top:1px solid;border-left:1px solid}
.tick.tr{top:-1px;right:-1px;border-top:1px solid;border-right:1px solid}
.tick.bl{bottom:-1px;left:-1px;border-bottom:1px solid;border-left:1px solid}
.tick.br{bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border-bottom:1px solid;border-right:1px solid}
.stage-ui{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.chip{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 15px;cursor:pointer;transition:.3s}
.chip:hover{color:var(--brass);border-color:rgba(230,181,115,.5)}
.scrub{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.scrub span{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
input[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;width:170px;height:2px;background:var(--line2);border-radius:2px;outline:none}
input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--brass);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(230,181,115,.8);cursor:grab}
input[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:13px;height:13px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brass);cursor:grab}
.stage-cap{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d7482;text-align:center;max-width:460px}
@media(max-width:960px){.hero-in{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px 0}
 .stats div:nth-child(2){border-right:0}}

/* ============ ticker ============ */
.ticker{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03),transparent)}
.tick-in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:marq 42s linear infinite}
.tick-in span{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7d8492;padding:14px 26px;white-space:nowrap}
.tick-in span b{color:var(--brass);font-weight:500}
@keyframes marq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

/* ============ sections ============ */
.sec{padding:100px 26px}
.sec-in{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto}
.shead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:52px}
.shead .num{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--brass);padding-top:12px;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(230,181,115,.4)}
.shead h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3.6vw,45px);max-width:22ch}
.shead .sub{color:var(--dim);margin-top:14px;max-width:56ch;font-size:16px}

.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:60px}
.about-copy p{color:#b9c0cc;margin-bottom:18px}
.about-copy p:first-child::first-letter{font-family:var(--ff-disp);font-size:52px;float:left;line-height:.82;
  padding:6px 12px 0 0;color:var(--brass)}
.facts{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--panel)}
.facts li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:15px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
.facts li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.facts b{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);font-weight:400}
.facts span{font-family:var(--ff-disp);font-size:16px}
@media(max-width:900px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}}

/* ============ editions ============ */
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}
@media(max-width:1080px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:560px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.edition{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:
  linear-gradient(170deg,rgba(255,255,255,.05),rgba(255,255,255,0) 40%),var(--panel);
  overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.4s}
.edition:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--line2);box-shadow:0 26px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.9)}
.ed-visual{position:relative;padding:10px 10px 0}
.edition-canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:14px;background:#0c0e14}
.badge{position:absolute;top:20px;left:20px;z-index:3;font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;
  text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(6,7,11,.78);border:1px solid var(--line2);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
.badge.ok{color:#8ee0b0;border-color:rgba(142,224,176,.4)}
.badge.out{color:#ff9a8b;border-color:rgba(255,154,139,.45)}
.badge.soon{color:#b8a9ff;border-color:rgba(184,169,255,.45)}
.ed-body{padding:18px 20px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;flex:1}
.ed-body h3{font-size:22px}
.ed-meta{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.ed-body p.desc{font-size:13.5px;color:#a7aeba;flex:1}
.ed-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:6px;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.price{font-family:var(--ff-disp);font-size:21px}
.price s{color:#5f6674;font-size:14px;margin-left:7px}
.buy,.notify{font-family:var(--ff-body);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
  border:1px solid transparent;transition:.3s}
.buy{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f6d9a6,var(--brass) 48%,var(--brass2));color:#231607;font-weight:600}
.buy:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 10px 26px -10px rgba(230,181,115,.8)}
.notify{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border-color:var(--line2);color:var(--dim)}
.notify:hover{color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--line2)}
.stamp{position:absolute;z-index:4;top:34%;left:-6%;right:-6%;text-align:center;transform:rotate(-11deg);
  font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:clamp(15px,2.1vw,21px);letter-spacing:.3em;color:#ffb0a2;
  border-top:2px solid rgba(255,120,100,.75);border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,120,100,.75);padding:7px 0;
  background:rgba(30,6,4,.45);text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.8);pointer-events:none}
.edition[data-state="sold-out"] .edition-canvas{filter:grayscale(.55) brightness(.62) contrast(1.05)}
.edition[data-state="sold-out"]{border-color:rgba(255,140,120,.22)}
.edition[data-state="coming-soon"] .edition-canvas{filter:brightness(.9) saturate(1.1)}
.edition[data-state="coming-soon"]{border-color:rgba(155,139,221,.26)}
.ed-note{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7d8492}

/* ============ process ============ */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}
@media(max-width:980px){.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:520px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.step{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;background:var(--panel);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.step::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 auto auto 0;width:100%;height:1px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--brass),transparent);opacity:.5}
.step i{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-style:normal;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--brass)}
.step h3{font-size:19px;margin:14px 0 9px}
.step p{font-size:13.5px;color:#a7aeba}

/* ============ specs / cta ============ */
.spec-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
@media(max-width:900px){.spec-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.spec-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:var(--panel);padding:28px}
.spec-card h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:16px}
.spec-card table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.spec-card td{padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
.spec-card td:last-child{text-align:right;font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#cfd5df}
.spec-card tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
.fine li{font-size:13.5px;color:#a7aeba;margin-bottom:10px}
.cta{margin:0 26px 100px;max-width:var(--max);}
.cta-in{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;border:1px solid rgba(230,181,115,.3);border-radius:26px;padding:56px 44px;
  text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(700px 300px at 50% 0,rgba(230,181,115,.14),transparent 70%),var(--panel2)}
.cta-in h2{font-size:clamp(27px,3.6vw,42px)}
.cta-in p{color:var(--dim);margin:16px auto 28px;max-width:52ch}

/* ============ footer ============ */
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:48px 26px 34px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.foot-in{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:30px;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}
.foot-in p{font-size:13px;color:#7d8492;max-width:42ch}
.foot-col h4{font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 12px}
.foot-col a{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:#a7aeba;margin-bottom:8px}
.foot-col a:hover{color:var(--brass)}
.legal{max-width:var(--max);margin:34px auto 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:10px;
  letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5f6674}

/* ============ cart + toast ============ */
.cartpill{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:80;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line2);background:rgba(10,12,18,.9);
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);font-family:var(--ff-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
.cartpill b{color:var(--brass);font-weight:600}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:26px;transform:translate(-50%,26px);z-index:90;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;
  padding:13px 22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f6d9a6,var(--brass));color:#231607;
  font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 20px 46px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.9);transition:.4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}

/* reveal */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1),transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}.tick-in{animation:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="nav-in">
    <a class="brand" href="#top">
      <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="mg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#fff0d4"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#e6b573"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#a8702a"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <polygon points="20,2 35.6,11 35.6,29 20,38 4.4,29 4.4,11" fill="none" stroke="url(#mg)" stroke-width="2"/>
        <polygon points="20,7.5 30.8,13.8 30.8,26.2 20,32.5 9.2,26.2 9.2,13.8" fill="rgba(230,181,115,.12)"/>
        <text x="20" y="25.4" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Georgia,serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" fill="url(#mg)">WT</text>
      </svg>
      <span class="brand-txt">WastedToken<em>Mint</em></span>
    </a>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#about">The Mint</a>
      <a href="#collection">Editions</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#spec">Specs</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="#collection">Claim a coin</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <!-- ============== HERO ============== -->
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-in">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Series IV · struck in Rotterdam &amp; Reno</p>
        <h1>Coins for the<br><span class="grad">gloriously wasted</span> hours.</h1>
        <p class="lede">WastedToken Mint presses physical challenge coins the old way: hardened steel dies,
          160 tonnes of pressure, one strike per face. Numbered on the reeded edge, finished by hand,
          and heavy enough to end an argument.</p>
        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a class="btn primary" href="#collection">Browse the editions</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#spec">Read the spec sheet</a>
        </div>
        <dl class="stats">
          <div><dt>Diameter</dt><dd>45 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Thickness</dt><dd>5.8 mm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Edge</dt><dd>100 reeds</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Mass</dt><dd>58 g</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-stage reveal">
        <div class="stage-frame">
          <span class="tick tl"></span><span class="tick tr"></span><span class="tick bl"></span><span class="tick br"></span>
          <canvas id="coin-hero" width="600" height="600" aria-label="The WastedToken Mint challenge coin, rotating to show both faces and its reeded edge"></canvas>
        </div>
        <div class="stage-ui">
          <button id="playToggle" class="chip" type="button">Pause spin</button>
          <label class="scrub"><span>Inspect</span><input id="scrub" type="range" min="0" max="1000" value="0" aria-label="Scrub coin rotation"></label>
        </div>
        <p class="stage-cap">Obverse: the Mint emblem in raised relief · Reverse: 10,000 TOKENS · Edge: 100 reeds, hand-numbered</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="tick-in" id="tickIn"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============== ABOUT ============== -->
  <section class="sec" id="about">
    <div class="sec-in">
      <div class="shead reveal">
        <span class="num">01 / The Mint</span>
        <div>
          <h2>A small mint with an unreasonable tolerance.</h2>
          <p class="sub">Founded in 2019 in a leaky machine shop by two die-sinkers and a very patient accountant.
            We make one thing: challenge coins that feel like they were issued by an institution that no longer exists.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-copy reveal">
          <p>Everything begins as a drawing at four times final size. The relief is modelled in clay-grey plasticine,
            digitised, then cut into H13 tool steel on a five-axis engraver. A die takes eleven days and roughly
            forty ruined tempers to finish. When it is right, it looks like nothing — a mirror with a shadow in it.</p>
          <p>Our blanks are cast in a 92/8 brass alloy with a copper-rich core, annealed, tumbled, then struck twice
            at 160 tonnes: once to move the metal, once to sharpen the edges of the letters. The reeded collar puts
            exactly one hundred ridges around the circumference, which is how you can tell one of ours from a keyring
            fob printed by somebody's cousin.</p>
          <p>Finishing is human work. Each coin is antiqued, relieved with a brass brush, sealed, weighed,
            and numbered on the edge with a hand punch. If a coin does not ring true when it lands on the bench,
            it goes back to the melt. About one in fourteen does.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="facts reveal">
